    "turn_text": "There's an old saying that when you get to Congress, you look around and you think, how did I get here? And then after a year or two, you look around and you think, how did that prove? Exactly. And a lot of that has to do with your heart for legislating. Do you want to help people or do you want to throw bombs?",
