  {
    "episode_id": 90943,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90943.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 19,
    "turn_text": "So there's a great thread that you draw in this. And I really enjoyed it because I saw it through your eyes and it's so interesting to me. But we really started dealing with all of these issues when there was an investigation of Hillary Clinton's email. And a group of us were asked to sort of interview these different witnesses from the FBI. And I worked in federal law enforcement for years, and the FBI was a great agency, and I just couldn't believe, I couldn't have them that they would go rogue and be engaged in partisan activities. And I want you to talk a little bit about that, but then I want you to talk about how that group at the top of the FBI became the same group that decided they were going to investigate Donald Trump, and actually used false information in the dossier submitted documents to the FISA court, affidavits sworn affidavits of the FISA court that have come under scrutiny. And so you've got this group, what were your thoughts when you heard about the Hillary Clinton",
