    "turn_text": "and then turned around and started an investigation of President Trump. In order to get the Mueller investigation going, the director of the FBI, James Comey, leaked information about his boss, the president of the United States, to try to get a special counsel appointed, to try to get the Department of Justice recused, the very Department of Justice that exonerated Hillary Clinton now is so unfair that they can't look at President Trump. What were your thoughts when you heard about the leak of information from the director?",
