  {
    "episode_id": 90943,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90943.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 36,
    "turn_text": "Any time you serve a subpoena, someone's going to talk about the nature of the subpoena. So there's a lot of sources of information that it could have given the information to the news organizations. But it seemed to me that there were a few members of Congress, Adam Schiff, Swalwell from California, some others, that made outrageous statements.",
