      },
      {
        "text": "Robert Mueller is known as a highly competent law enforcement witness.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Mueller answers questions directly and has strong factual command.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Congress does not operate spontaneously; it plans ahead for major events.",
        "confidence": 0.92
