    "turn_text": "So Doug, in the book The Clock and the Calendar, one of my favorite quotes is the description that you have for the standard for impeachment. You say, impeachment should never be a threat or a tool to carry out the wishes of a temporary congressional majority against a president they simply do not like. And that's really what happened here. What do you think of in terms of how they used impeachment, how the Democrats used impeachment against Donald Trump?",
