    "turn_text": "Right. I want to talk about where do we go from here. And you and I both love the institution. And there's times where I just roll my eyes with some of the things that Speaker Pelosi has been involved in recently. And some of the things, frankly, from our side that I just wish we saw the institution in a longer term perspective, but we now have magnetometers. Before you walk on the floor, you have to go through magnetometer. I have a hip replacement. I have a metal hip. I can't make it through a",
